WEBVTT

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:06.850 line:0 align:center
This is Layout. It shows how the cards are arranged on your dash.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.450 line:0 align:center
Drag a card to move it wherever you want.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:19.050 line:0 align:center
Drag a handle to resize it.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:25.850 line:0 align:center
Very small cards can't show every widget. Experiment, and check the preview.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.325 line:0 align:center
While you drag, cards snap to the best size and position.

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:36.225 line:0 align:center
Every change can be undone.

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:39.975 line:0 align:center
Discard takes you back to the last version you saved.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:47.025 line:0 align:center
So: the dock on one side, then columns of cards you can resize.

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:53.475 line:0 align:center
Click plus at the side to add a column, while the screen has room for it.

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:59.600 line:0 align:center
At some point the screen is full, and no more columns fit.

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:04.250 line:0 align:center
To remove a card or column, click its minus button.

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:09.250 line:0 align:center
New columns can go on the left or on the right.

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:14.250 line:0 align:center
Or click New column at the bottom.

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.625 line:0 align:center
It stops adding columns once the screen is full.

00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:24.450 line:0 align:center
Add card adds a single card.

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:29.725 line:0 align:center
Every card holds one widget, like an OBD value or live ride data.

00:01:30.275 --> 00:01:34.725 line:0 align:center
The fuel value is estimated from the settings you entered on the phone.

00:01:36.925 --> 00:01:40.900 line:0 align:center
Next, in the Widgets video, you'll choose what each card shows.
